1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,640
 The Savior's Peace is made manifest through the comforting power of the Holy Ghost.

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:13,400
 That comfort will help us when we go through the inevitable hardships of life and times

3
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:18,480
 when we can't fix things on our own.

4
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:23,360
 Living worthy of the constant companionship of the Holy Ghost should be one of our highest

5
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:25,360
 priorities.

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,280
 I bear my witness that Jesus Christ lives.

